{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "Track",
  "_about": "Track HUD, generated by design/gen_hud.py: twelve shift lights across the top, the gear big on the left (red at the shift point) with SHIFT beside it, a G-meter on the right (the dot at the lateral and longitudinal g with a fading trail, the outline of the most g this drive in every direction, its range from the G-meter tab) with the side g, the fore / aft g and the best of the drive beside it. Fitted (Nov 9 2026) to the HUD as BMW's own height-adjust frame shows it, x 120..680, y 100..380, and kept clear of the bottom-left x 120..350, y 235..380, where BMW draws its speed and speed-limit sign (and in Sport its rev band) over ours. To change it, copy this file into the app data folder layouts/ (scripts/deploy.sh); the app reloads it by itself. Widget types and tokens: see the header of hud.js.",
